    'Satvastones anti-tarnish minimal rings for women are engineered specifically for continuous, 24/7 Indian wear. Beneath the warm 18K gold vacuum PVD plasma finish sits solid 316L surgical stainless steel—the same corrosion-resistant, biocompatible alloy used in medical implants. Because PVD bonds gold at the atomic level inside a vacuum chamber, it is roughly 10 times more durable than standard electroplating and never leaves green marks on your fingers.',
    'Style a single sleek band for office wear, stack sculpted dome and solitaire rings for weekends, or pair them with our waterproof bracelets and necklaces. Use our built-in Ring Size Finder before ordering, enjoy 7-day easy size exchanges, Cash on Delivery, and free pan-India shipping above ₹499.'
