    'Designed for birthdays, bridesmaid hampers, college gifting, and self-care treats, each mystery box experience delivers curated everyday staples—a mix of waterproof necklaces, minimal rings, hypoallergenic earrings, or stackable bracelets—that pair effortlessly with both western outfits and Indian festive sarees.',
    'Every jar is hand-packed, inspected for finish quality, and sealed at our Chala, Vapi atelier in Gujarat before being dispatched within 24–48 hours via express air couriers. Orders above ₹499 qualify for free pan-India delivery, Cash on Delivery, and official GST tax invoicing.'
